//   node test/mutants/run-mutants apiGet      # one function's mutants only
//
// The file has no .js extension on purpose: `node --test` collects every
// *.js file under test/, so a run-mutants.js would run inside `npm test`.
//
// Each mutant edits scripts/daily-news.js in place, `node --test` runs, and
// the file is restored from a backup copy. The run refuses to start unless
// HEAD's script is byte-identical to the pinned head's and the working file
// matches HEAD, and refuses to print the SUMMARY unless the file matches HEAD
// again at the end.

